## 2. Repo layout

```
blackvaultdocs/
├── .cursorrules                   ← you are here
├── AGENTS.md                      ← product narrative + source list
├── backend/                       ← Symfony 7 API
│   ├── compose.yaml               ← local-only Postgres for dev; prod = RDS MySQL
│   ├── config/
│   ├── migrations/
│   │   └── 000_bvd_schema.sql     ← canonical DDL, apply by hand with mysql
│   ├── public/index.php
│   ├── src/
│   │   ├── Command/ScrapeCommand.php          ← `app:bvd:scrape`
│   │   ├── Controller/HealthController.php
│   │   ├── Controller/PublicController.php    ← `/api/public/*` read API
│   │   └── Service/ArchivesGovScraper.php     ← paced archives.gov crawler
│   └── .env                       ← COMMITTED (Symfony convention) — no secrets beyond RDS creds
└── frontend/                      ← Next.js 16 static export
    ├── app/
    │   ├── layout.tsx / page.tsx
    │   ├── components/SiteChrome.tsx
    │   ├── lib/api.ts             ← typed client for /api/public/*
    │   ├── topics/[slug]/         ← collection detail (one per release)
    │   ├── documents/[slug]/      ← document detail (one per PDF)
    │   └── agencies/[slug]/       ← source-agency detail
    ├── scripts/generate-sitemap.mjs   ← runs in `prebuild`
    └── next.config.ts             ← output: "export", trailingSlash: true
```

Ignore the `peptidedive.com` references in `frontend/AGENTS.md` and
`frontend/app/AGENTS.md` — those were copied from the peptidedive template
and should be treated as stale until rewritten.

